OL,3,GNEWSAPubs want help from government and
OL,4,Acustomers                              
OL,6,FPubs are calling for more government   
OL,7,Fsupport and for customers to use them  
OL,8,Fmore, as many struggle to stay afloat. 
OL,10,FAmong measures being asked for is a    
OL,11,Flower rate of VAT for pubs as they     
OL,12,Fbattle with high energy costs.         
OL,14,FOne village pub landlord in Probus,    
OL,15,FCornwall, said: "The government like to
OL,16,Fthink they're listening to us and have 
OL,17,Fintroduced things like business rate   
OL,18,Frelief but that doesn't even scratch   
OL,19,Fthe surface." Another in Camborne said 
OL,20,Fit would have to "close the doors for  
OL,21,Fgood" without more support from local  
OL,22,Fpeople.                                
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
