OL,3,GNEWSAPubs want help from government and
OL,4,Acustomers                              
OL,6,FThe government said it was "on the side
OL,7,Fof businesses" and had taken a number  
OL,8,Fof measures to allow more "breathing   
OL,9,Fspace".                                
